    "Mailpipe cannot read the extension’s shared folder. Check the installation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe cannot read the extension’s shared folder. Check the installation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe 无法读取扩展的共享目录。请检查安装。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe no puede leer la carpeta compartida de la extensión. Revisa la instalación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mailpipe checks for ready replies once a day while running. If it misses the scheduled time, it checks when it next runs that day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe checks for ready replies once a day while running. If it misses the scheduled time, it checks when it next runs that day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe 每天在运行时检查一次有多少封邮件可回复。错过提醒时间后，会在当天恢复运行时补查。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe comprueba una vez al día si hay respuestas listas. Si no está en marcha a la hora prevista, lo comprueba cuando vuelve a ejecutarse ese día."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mailpipe saves messages and drafts on this Mac. Use the reply arrow to review and send in Apple Mail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe saves messages and drafts on this Mac. Use the reply arrow to review and send in Apple Mail."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来信和草稿由 Mailpipe 保存在这台 Mac 上。点回复箭头可在 Apple Mail 打开撰写窗口，由你检查并发送。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe guarda mensajes y borradores en este Mac. Usa la flecha de respuesta para revisar y enviar desde Apple Mail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mailpipe sends these instructions to %1$@ for new drafts and when you regenerate a reply. Clear the prompt and save to use the default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe sends these instructions to %1$@ for new drafts and when you regenerate a reply. Clear the prompt and save to use the default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成新草稿或手动重新生成回复时，Mailpipe 会将这段提示词发送给 %1$@。清空并保存即可恢复默认。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe envía estas instrucciones a %1$@ al crear borradores y cuando vuelves a generar una respuesta. Para usar las instrucciones predeterminadas, borra el texto y guarda el cambio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mailpipe stores mail, drafts and settings on this Mac. Your agent receives the subject and body of authorized messages along with any reply prompt you save.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe stores mail, drafts and settings on this Mac. Your agent receives the subject and body of authorized messages along with any reply prompt you save."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe 在这台 Mac 上保存来信、草稿和设置。起草时，Agent 会收到已授权邮件的主题和正文，以及你保存的回复提示词。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe guarda los mensajes, borradores y ajustes en este Mac. Tu agente recibe el asunto y el cuerpo de los mensajes autorizados junto con las instrucciones de respuesta que hayas guardado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mailpipe stores messages and drafts on your Mac. Your chosen agent receives only authorized content. Review each draft and decide whether to send it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe stores messages and drafts on your Mac. Your chosen agent receives only authorized content. Review each draft and decide whether to send it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe 在你的 Mac 上保存来信和草稿，只把你授权的内容交给所选 Agent 写回复。你审阅草稿，再决定是否发送。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mailpipe guarda los mensajes y borradores en tu Mac. El agente que elijas solo recibe el contenido autorizado. Revisa cada borrador y decide si quieres enviarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
